      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Request lifecycle latency** \u2014 one panel per T0\u2192T10 stage from ADR-0015. Requires the gateway feature flag `GATEWAY_FEATURE_FLAGS_LIFECYCLE_METRICS=true`; with it off, panels are empty.\n\n**Reading gaps (ADR \u00a77):** a missing/zero series means traffic didn't reach that stage, not that instrumentation is broken. Cache hits skip `upstreamwait`/rebuilder (healthy); `acks=0` produce skips `total`; a ~30s `total` spike with no `upstreamwait` is an upstream timeout.\n\n**Percentiles (ADR \u00a74):** buckets start at 1ms, so P99 reads flat for the sub-ms stages until they degrade; use mean and max for those, P99 for `upstreamwait`."
      },
      "datasource": null
    }
  ],
